      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Ultimate Upscale\n\nEnlarges the picture it is given with the upscale model, then repaints it tile by tile with the checkpoint and prompts. In ImageLab the Picture is the step above's output (or one you drop), and the Checkpoint, prompt, seed and clip skip follow the session's model unless you set them here. Works with any SD 1.5 / SDXL checkpoint (Pony, Illustrious, NoobAI included).\n\n- **upscale_by** 2 doubles each side. 3 or 4 works on a big GPU; it only takes longer.\n- **denoise** 0.3-0.4 adds detail and keeps the picture. Above 0.5 tiles start to invent things.\n- **tile_width / height** 1024 for SDXL-class models, 512 for SD 1.5.\n- **Upscaler:** 4x-UltraSharp for most pictures, 4x-AnimeSharp for anime / illustration.\n- **seam_fix_mode:** leave None; try Band Pass if tile edges show.\n"
      ],
      "title": "About this workflow"
    }
